# ARM assembly (A32, T32, A64): Arm Architecture Reference Manual and the GNU as ARM dialect; requirements/languages/armasm.md
name     armasm arm aarch64 arm64

keyword  mov mvn add adds sub subs mul madd sdiv udiv and orr eor bic lsl lsr asr ror cmp cmn tst teq
keyword  b bl blr br bx blx ret beq bne bgt bge blt ble bhi bls cbz cbnz ldr ldrb ldrh str strb strh ldp
keyword  stp ldm stm push pop adr adrp svc nop movz movk csel cset
builtin  r0 r1 r2 r3 r4 r5 r6 r7 r8 r9 r10 r11 r12 r13 r14 r15 sp lr pc fp xzr wzr x0 x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x6
builtin  x7 x8 x9 x10 x11 x12 x13 x14 x15 x16 x17 x18 x19 x20 x21 x22 x23 x24 x25 x26 x27 x28 x29 x30
builtin  w0 w1 w2 w3 w4 w5 w6 w7 w8 w9 w10 w11 w12 w13 w14 w15
fold-case

line-comment   @ // ;
block-comment  /* */
string   " "  : escapes
sigil    .    : meta
operators  #+-*/:,[]!=
hook     asm-label
